# Generate one of your own for free at
# https://start.gg/admin/profile/developer
# Read more about start.gg auth here:
# https://developer.start.gg/docs/authentication
STARTGG_TOKEN=YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

# Off-box durability for event-mode rooms (src/party/snapshot-store.ts).
# PartyKit's runtime can't bind Cloudflare resources, so R2 is reached over its
# S3-compatible endpoint with an R2 API token scoped to this one bucket.
# Leave unset to run on partykit room storage alone — which rejects any value
# over 131072 bytes, so a long event will silently stop saving without this.
# In production these are set with `npx partykit env add <NAME>`; the change
# only takes effect on the next deploy.
R2_ACCOUNT_ID=SOMETHING
R2_BUCKET=ddr-tools-event-snapshots
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=SOMETHING
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=SOMETHING

# Read-only access to the piu-tourney-maker project, so its upcoming matches
# can be picked as a draw source. Different project from the two above. The
# anon key is public by design (it ships in tourney-maker's own bundle) and
# row-level security is what limits what it can read. Leave both unset to
# build without the tourney maker tab.
PIU_TOURNEY_SUPABASE_URL=https://SOMETHING.supabase.co
PIU_TOURNEY_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=SOMETHING
